Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:02:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Fix: keys and ROUT SEL notes sounding another track while
 the UI borrows the selection

Stage's track rows (cur_entry for each row), MIDI LEARN and a new project set song.sel to another
track for a moment and back, in the main loop. The audio interrupt reads song.sel for a key press
(kb_trk), ROUT SEL routing and capture, so a key or note landing in that window played the
borrowed track's sound. Borrowers now mark the selection borrowed (sel_borrow_begin/end) and the
interrupt reads SEL_LIVE, the player's selection. Present in upstream Melodee.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0131vpfZVN4vprBnQkpmn5yn
